    "title": "Emily Ratajkowski's Victoria's Secret Fashion Show Debut",
    "text": "• Emily Ratajkowski made her Victoria’s Secret fashion show runway debut in 2023.\n• She is 34 years old and has been part of the Victoria’s Secret family prior to this event.\n• Ratajkowski walked in the brand’s Icon Campaign.\n• She wore a three-dimensional orchid ensemble that replaced the traditional wings.\n• The outfit included crystal-embellished petals, a pale purple bra and underwear set, opera-length gloves, and over-the-knee lace-up open-toe heels.\n• Ratajkowski is 5'7\" tall and appeared confident on the runway.\n• She joined seasoned Victoria’s Secret models including Gigi Hadid, Bella Hadid, Adriana Lima, Paloma Esser, and Candice Swanepoel.\n• Other first-time models included WNBA star Angel Reese, Amelia Gray Hamlin, and Iris Law.\n• Before the show, Ratajkowski posed for photos with makeup artist Dame Pat McGrath.\n• In a 2023 interview, Ratajkowski expressed her admiration for iconic models like Gisele Bündchen, Candice Swanepoel, Naomi Campbell, and Adriana Lima.",
